## Assets — extracted game data, vendored and far too large for git.
## Exception: assets/game/shader/ (11 small GLSL files). Those are the only part of the
## asset tree that gets hand-edited, and nothing else records those edits — the assets are
## re-extracted wholesale, so an untracked change there is one `rm -rf` from being lost.
## Re-including needs the parent dirs left un-ignored: git cannot re-include a file whose
## parent directory is itself excluded, hence `assets/*` rather than `assets/`.
assets/*
!assets/game/
assets/game/*
!assets/game/shader/
assets_debug/

